'''Area 22''' (エリア22 ''Eria 22'', '''Area 22''') is the 43rd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was introduced in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Difficulty ranges from insanely high to near-absent, based on one's [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]]. Speaking of, you should at least have all of the Treasures from Cats of the Cosmos Chapter 1, and maybe some more from Chapter 2 just to be safe. Good [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]] are recommended if one is lacking in Treasures, and they're still welcome even if Treasures are already obtained. [[Cat Abduction]], [[Chupacabra Love]], and [[Offworld Weary]] are all fairly easy, while [[Roswell Incident]], [[Adamski Type]] and [[Tunguska Event]] are mid-difficulty, but nothing compared to some previous sub-chapters.
{{LegendDiff|120|130|100}}

==New Features==
While not their first appearance in-game, Starred Aliens are introduced to Stories of Legend in this sub-chapter. They are unaffected by the [[anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] of [[Into the Future]], instead having their own Treasure sets found in [[Cats of the Cosmos]].

This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Youcan]]: A Starred Alien/[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Two Can]] with [[Area Attack]], slightly longer [[Wave Attack]]s and a 266,000 HP [[Barrier]].

